                        "language": "english",
                        "review": " Surprisingly fun little game. I got it on sale and I enjoyed it a lot. It's a compelling story although short and the combat and exploration are both great. It took me 5 hours to complete it, explore every part of the map and find all of the holograms.\n\nThe negatives are that the narrator can get a little repetitive and there are a bunch of annoying bugs though none are game breaking. I'll list some that I encountered so you can get an idea. Getting stuck in place and having to save and reload, jumping in the wrong direction for no reason and sometimes when gliding the booster clouds just launch you into the ground.  \nDespite the issues I encountered I definitely recommend this game.\n",
